  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>ComStar's infantry served across the Inner Sphere in garrison and security roles, stationed on HPG compound worlds where they provided protection for the Order's most critical infrastructure while maintaining the facade of a purely defensive force. Manning assault-class field autocannon, these gun crews bring devastating close-range firepower that can cripple armored vehicles and even threaten BattleMech limbs, though the weapon's bulk limits mobility and rate of repositioning.</p>"
